own code.", "The service lived up to the hype."], "t": 595.43, "src": {"t": "So perhaps one way to build up your self-esteem is to live up to your own code – very rigorously have one and then live up to it.", "a": "audio/t12/s12.mp3", "hl": [54, 64], "sp": "Naval", "oa": "audio/t12o/s12.mp3", "oab": [2.56, 4.78], "oas": ["audio/t12o/s12.mp3"], "zh": "所以，也许建立自尊的一个方法，就是做到你自己的准则——非常严格地给自己定一套，然后做到它。", "zb": [17, 19]}, "tt": {"w": 595.43, "ex": [["To", 598.69], ["live", 598.84], ["up", 599.08], ["to", 599.23], ["something", 599.38], ["means", 599.86], ["to", 600.15], ["meet", 600.3], ["a", 600.54], ["standard", 600.64], ["or", 601.08], ["promise.", 601.22]], "exs": [[["I", 605.52], ["want", 605.53], ["to", 605.55], ["live", 605.56], ["up", 605.57], ["to", 605.59], ["my", 605.6], ["own", 605.7], ["code.", 606.62]], [["The", 610.57], ["service", 610.62], ["lived", 610.81], ["up", 611.15], ["to", 611.41], ["the", 611.57], ["hype.", 611.65]]], "z": [607.24, 612.69], "o": 615.36}}, {"n": 23, "w": "rigorously", "pos": "adv.", "zh": "严格地", "ex": "Rigorously means very carefully and strictly.", "exs": ["I rigorously clean my tools.", "Test it rigorously."], "t": 624.39, "src": {"t": "So perhaps one way to build up your self-esteem is to live up to your own code – very rigorously have one and then live up to it.", "a": "audio/t12/s12.mp3", "hl": [86, 96], "sp": "Naval", "oa": "audio/t12o/s12.mp3", "oab": [4.88, 7.49], "oas": ["audio/t12o/s12.mp3"], "zh": "所以，也许建立自尊的一个方法，就是做到你自己的准则——非常严格地给自己定一套，然后做到它。", "zb": [29, 32]}, "tt": {"w": 624.39, "ex": [["Rigorously", 627.37], ["means", 627.54], ["very", 628.06], ["carefully", 628.44], ["and", 628.9], ["strictly.", 629.22]], "exs": [[["I", 632.88], ["rigorously", 632.93], ["clean", 633.18], ["my", 633.52], ["tools.", 633.82]], [["Test", 637.14], ["it", 638.44], ["rigorously.", 638.62]]], "z": [634.66, 640.0], "o": 642.25}}, {"n": 24, "w": "raise", "pos": "v.", "zh": "提升；提高", "ex": "To raise means to lift or increase something.", "exs": [