p3", "oab": [5.08, 7.79], "oas": ["audio/t12o/s19.mp3"], "zh": "所以这告诉我，即使我没有被爱，创造爱的方法就是去给予爱，通过牺牲和责任去表达爱。", "zb": [36, 38]}, "tt": {"w": 963.25, "ex": [["To", 966.26], ["express", 966.43], ["means", 966.87], ["to", 967.05], ["show", 967.33], ["a", 967.53], ["feeling", 967.65], ["or", 968.01], ["idea.", 968.41]], "exs": [[["Express", 971.89], ["love", 972.21], ["through", 972.65], ["actions.", 972.91]], [["I", 976.88], ["can't", 977.02], ["express", 977.3], ["how", 977.58], ["happy", 977.86], ["I", 978.28], ["am.", 978.46]]], "z": [974.19, 979.48], "o": 982.52}}, {"n": 36, "w": "duty", "pos": "n.", "zh": "责任；义务", "ex": "A duty is something you must do because it's right or it's your job.", "exs": ["It's my duty to keep clients safe.", "Family duty matters to her."], "t": 991.62, "src": {"t": "So that tells me that even if I am not being loved, the way to create love is to give love, to express love through sacrifice and through duty.", "a": "audio/t12/s19.mp3", "hl": [138, 142], "sp": "Naval", "oa": "audio/t12o/s19.mp3", "oab": [5.08, 7.79], "oas": ["audio/t12o/s19.mp3"], "zh": "所以这告诉我，即使我没有被爱，创造爱的方法就是去给予爱，通过牺牲和责任去表达爱。", "zb": [33, 35]}, "tt": {"w": 991.62, "ex": [["A", 994.68], ["duty", 994.82], ["is", 995.02], ["something", 995.34], ["you", 995.6], ["must", 995.9], ["do", 996.06], ["because", 996.36], ["it's", 996.98], ["right", 997.26], ["or", 997.52], ["it's", 997.92], ["your", 998.14], ["job.", 998.24]], "exs": [[["It's", 1001.76], ["my", 1001.98], ["duty", 1002.12], ["to", 1002.76], ["keep", 1002.84], ["clients", 1002.94], ["safe.", 1003.24]], [["Family", 1008.47], ["duty", 1008.52], ["matters", 1008.79], ["to", 1009.19], ["her.", 1009.53]]], "z": [1004.58, 1010.33], "o": 1013.22}}, {"n": 37, "w": "build up", "pos": "phrasal verb", "zh": "建立；增强", "ex": "To build up means to make something stronger over time.", "exs": ["Build up your confidence slowly.", "She built up her savings."], "t": 1022.31, "src": {"t": "And so I think doing things like that can build up your self-esteem really fast.", "a": "audio/t12/s20.mp3", "hl": [42, 50], "sp": "Naval", "oa": "audio/t12o/s20.mp3", "oab": [1.32, 3.39], "oas": ["audio/t12o/s20.mp3"], "zh": "所以我觉得，做这样的事能让你的自尊很快建立起来。", "zb": [19, 21]}, "tt": {"w": 1022.31, "ex": [["To", 1025.37], ["build", 1025.42], ["up", 1025.6], ["means", 1025.84], ["to", 1026.06], ["make", 1026.52], ["something", 1026.64], ["stronger", 1026.98], ["over", 1027.36], ["time.", 1027.82]], "exs": [[["Build", 1031.22], ["up", 1031.32], ["your", 1031.58], ["confidence", 1031.72], ["slowly.", 1032.16]], [["She", 1036.21], ["built", 1036.29], ["up", 1036.47], ["her", 1036.73], ["savings.", 1036.85]]], "z": [1033.5, 1038.11], "o": 1040.47}}, {"n": 38, "w": "sacrifice", "pos": "n. / v.", "zh": "牺牲", "ex": "A sacrifice is giving up something you value for something more important.", "exs": ["Parents make many sacrifices.", "I sacrificed my weekends for my studio."], "t": 1045.17, "src": {"t": "It’s interesting when you talk about sacrifice, because a lot of the time people say, “I sacrificed so much for my job.”", "a": "audio/t12/s21.mp3", "hl": [89, 99], "sp": "Chris", "oa": "audio/t12o/s21.mp3", "oab": [3.0, 4.85], "oas": ["audio/t12o/s21.mp3"], "zh": "你说到牺牲很有意思，因为很多时候人们会说：“我为工作牺牲了那么多。”", "zb": [3, 5]}, "tt": {"w": 1045.17, "ex": [["A", 1048.24], ["sacrifice", 1048.34], ["is", 1048.78], ["giving", 1049.32], ["up", 1049.52], ["something", 1049.76], ["you", 1050.08], ["value", 1050.38], ["for", 1050.74], ["something", 1051.36], ["more", 1051.68], ["important.", 1052.0]], "exs": [[["Parents", 1055.62], ["make", 1055.9], ["many", 1056.2], ["sacrifices.", 1056.42]], [["I", 1061.36], ["sacrificed", 1061.54], ["my", 1061.94], ["weekends", 1062.44], ["for", 1062.78], ["my", 1063.22], ["studio.", 1063.34]]], "z": [1058.22, 1064.52], "o": 1067.8}}, {"n": 39, "w": "genuinely", "pos": "adv.", "zh": "真正地；真诚地", "ex": "Genuinely means really and truly.", "exs": ["I'm genuinely happy for you.", "She genuinely cares."], "t": 1073.98, "src": {"t": "It’s like, yeah, but that was you sacrificing something that you wanted less for something that you wanted more, as opposed to genuinely taking some sort of cost.", "a": "audio/t12/s22.mp3", "hl": [127, 136], "sp": "Chris", "oa": "audio/t12o/s22.mp3", "oab": [5.7, 8.31], "oas": ["audio/t12o/s22.mp3"], "zh": "就像，对，但那只是你用自己没那么想要的东西，去换更想要的东西，而不是真正付出了什么代价。", "zb": [34, 36]}, "tt": {"w": 1073.98, "ex": [["Genuinely", 1077.22], ["means", 1077.71], ["really", 1077.76], ["and", 1079.05], ["truly.", 1079.05]], "exs": [[["I'm", 1082.11], ["genuinely", 1082.32], ["happy", 1082.7], ["for", 1083.12], ["you.", 1083.42]], [["She", 1087.16], ["genuinely", 1087.22], ["cares.", 1087.6]]], "z": [1084.3, 1089.0], "o": 1091.42}}, {"n": 40, "w": "cost", "pos": "n.", "zh": "代价；成本", "ex": "A cost is what you must give or lose to get something.", "exs": ["Every choice has a cost.", "The cost of fame is privacy."], "t": 1101.22, "src": {"t": "It’s like, yeah, but that was you sacrificing something that you wanted less for something that you wanted more, as opposed to genuinely taking some sort of cost.", "a": "audio/t12/s22.mp3", "hl": [157, 161], "sp": "Chris", "oa": "audio/t12o/s22.mp3", "oab": [5.7, 8.31], "oas": ["audio/t12o/s22.mp3"], "zh": "就像，对，但那只是你用自己没那么想要的东西，去换更想要的东西，而不是真正付出了什么代价。", "zb": [41, 43]}, "tt": {"w": 1101.22, "ex": [["A", 1103.88], ["cost", 1103.88], ["is", 1104.14], ["what", 1104.39], ["you", 1104.63], ["must", 1104.88], ["give", 1104.94], ["or", 1105.26], ["lose", 1105.6], ["to", 1105.82], ["get", 1106.16], ["something.", 1106.28]], "exs": [[["Every", 1109.83], ["choice", 1109.84], ["has", 1110.26], ["a", 1110.56], ["cost.", 1110.66]], [["The", 1115.11], ["cost", 1115.16], ["of", 1115.21], ["fame", 1115.37], ["is", 1115.63], ["privacy.", 1115.91]]], "z": [1111.9, 1117.21], "o": 1120.47}}], "seqsig": "557177ef4c3b"}